<title>UK: SOCCER-ARSENAL AND ASTON VILLA DRAW.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ARSENAL AND ASTON VILLA DRAW.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>English premier league result on Saturday:</p>
<p>Arsenal 2 (Ian Wright 13, Paul Merson 73)</p>
<p>Aston Villa 2 (Savo Milosevic 67, Dwight Yorke 74)</p>
<p>Halftime 1-0. Attendance: 38,130</p>
